  "description": "Spec-054 FR-009 — Adversarial mismatch in component (c) resource_uri.\n\nThe ReceiptEnvelope is correctly signed (valid JWS, valid kid in JWKS, valid\ntimestamp_evidence) and declares resource_uri = '/api/paid-resource'. At verify\ntime the auditor is presented with verification_inputs.resource_uri =\n'/api/different-resource'. When the verifier recomputes binding_hash over the\n5 components using the auditor's resource_uri, the resulting hash does NOT\nmatch the binding_hash declared in the signed payload.\n\nVerifier MUST reject with typed reason 'binding_mismatch' and identify the\nmismatched component as 'resource_uri'. It MUST NOT reject as 'unknown_kid',\n'delegation_invalid', or any signature-level reason — the envelope signature\nis cryptographically valid; only the semantic binding fails.",
  "test_kind": "binding_mismatch_resource",
